# Earflow Security

Full reference: `reports/SECURITY.md`

## Auth

- Access JWT TTL ~15 min; refresh long-lived; PBKDF2-SHA512 passwords
- Cookies: `mp_auth`, `mp_sid`, `mp_csrf` (artist variants: `*_artists`)
- MFA step-up for artist write ops; recovery codes encrypted in Postgres

## Gateway

- Never expose internal service keys to clients
- CSRF token HMAC-bound to session; validate on POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE
- Rate limits: do not remove or widen without justification

## Upload / stream

- Validate MIME, size, magic bytes on upload
- Stream cookies (`mp_stream`) signed; short-lived session tokens

## Secrets

- `JWT_SECRET`, `SERVICE_KEY_*`, `SESSION_ENCRYPTION_KEY` — env only
- Never log tokens, passwords, or recovery codes
